  "title": "ChatPage fixed height layout breaks on mobile and small viewports",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: UI. Severity: P2. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. ChatPage uses `height: 'calc(100vh - 180px)'` on the main content container (line 151). This assumes a specific header height of 180px. On mobile viewports where the sidebar collapses and the header may be different height, this calculation will be wrong, either cutting off content or leaving dead space. Additionally, the conversation list has a fixed width of 320px (line 159), which on small mobile screens (320px wide) would take the entire viewport, leaving no room for the message thread.",
